WEBVTT

00:14.479 --> 00:17.983
Don't die on me, Yomiko. Hang in there!

00:21.361 --> 00:23.405
Yomiko, don't you dare die!

00:23.488 --> 00:25.907
Don't die, okay? Come on!

00:32.706 --> 00:34.833
SURGERY IN PROGRESS

00:34.916 --> 00:36.918
Vines from head to toe?

00:37.502 --> 00:41.173
Is it even possible
to move after complete transfloration?

00:41.798 --> 00:43.467
As the Spiriflor grows,

00:43.550 --> 00:47.763
the body is devoured from within,
and that's how transfloration progresses.

00:47.846 --> 00:50.182
After that, it shouldn't be able to move.

00:50.766 --> 00:54.144
But why did it attack her?

01:04.362 --> 01:06.073
We managed to save her life.

01:07.491 --> 01:09.826
Upon recovery, she'll wake up.

01:12.579 --> 01:15.540
But the internal damage is severe.

01:15.624 --> 01:19.836
Depending on her condition,
we may need to remove some of her stomach.

01:21.880 --> 01:25.842
After that, she won't be able
to eat like she used to.

01:29.012 --> 01:29.846
Hey!

01:33.225 --> 01:36.228
Hey, slow down. Where are you going?

01:36.812 --> 01:37.979
To kill whoever did it.

01:38.063 --> 01:41.483
I heard its desire to kill
just before Yomiko got stabbed.

01:41.983 --> 01:42.943
If I follow the voice…

01:43.026 --> 01:44.319
You'll get killed.

01:45.529 --> 01:48.907
I understand your frustration,
but you only have two years left.

01:49.616 --> 01:52.202
Do you want to spend it on revenge?

01:53.745 --> 01:56.957
Yomiko might never be able to eat again.

01:58.083 --> 01:59.835
<i>She might never smile again.</i>

02:03.130 --> 02:05.841
I can't take it. I won't stand for it.

02:06.675 --> 02:08.426
Two years is nothing.

02:12.055 --> 02:13.932
You can't do it alone.

02:14.015 --> 02:16.810
With these serial murders going on,

02:16.893 --> 02:21.481
Horai had been assisting the investigation
at the request of the police.

02:22.065 --> 02:24.317
I'll nominate you to take her place.

02:26.236 --> 02:27.654
Thank you.

02:28.155 --> 02:32.617
But you're not allowed
to tell anyone about your ability.

02:32.701 --> 02:35.495
Not to the police
or anyone at Transflora Medical.

02:35.579 --> 02:36.788
What?

02:36.872 --> 02:39.082
You're not a normal transfloration case.

02:39.166 --> 02:42.210
If your secret gets out,
everyone will try to use you.

02:43.378 --> 02:48.049
Transflora Medical and the police
all harbor their own ulterior motives.

02:48.133 --> 02:49.134
Be careful.

02:49.217 --> 02:51.469
It's for your own good.

03:01.146 --> 03:05.442
I take it you're Toshiro Kamiya,
the new Special Investigator?

03:05.525 --> 03:08.528
Sorry for the wait.
National Police HQ called us in.

03:10.405 --> 03:12.991
This guy is Horai's replacement?

03:16.786 --> 03:20.206
Get that ugly face outta my sight,
you little shit.

03:20.290 --> 03:22.042
Akira.

03:22.125 --> 03:23.835
You're a little shit, too.

03:27.797 --> 03:30.926
Before throwing punches,
why don't we introduce ourselves?

03:31.426 --> 03:33.178
My name is Yo Kunibe.

03:33.261 --> 03:35.680
Transflora Medical No. 4,
Spiriflora Department,

03:35.764 --> 03:37.641
diplomatic relations office.

03:37.724 --> 03:41.228
And, working alongside yourself
as a Special Investigator…

03:41.311 --> 03:44.731
Akira Yatsuka, Deputy Chief of HR
at Transflora Medical No. 4.

03:44.814 --> 03:50.445
I'm Toshiro Kamiya
with the Spiriflor Locator Division.

03:50.528 --> 03:51.488
So you're just a grunt!

03:52.739 --> 03:56.243
So, you blabbed to the police
about the culprit being a vine man?

03:57.535 --> 04:00.247
Ideally, we would've
dealt with it ourselves.

04:01.248 --> 04:05.627
We wanna get rid of it, right?
Isn't it better to have more help?

04:05.710 --> 04:08.546
I understand that
you want to avenge Horai.

04:08.630 --> 04:12.509
But listen, Toshiro.
The culprit must not be killed.

04:12.592 --> 04:15.095
That's Transflora Medical's decision.

04:15.595 --> 04:16.888
Why? That thing--

04:16.972 --> 04:18.223
Listen here, grunt.

04:18.306 --> 04:22.936
Before you mouth off,
remember who pays your living expenses.

04:23.895 --> 04:25.730
If your testimony is true,

04:26.523 --> 04:30.819
this culprit will be
extraordinarily valuable for research.

04:31.861 --> 04:33.822
A key to human evolution.

04:34.489 --> 04:38.576
If we can live as normal humans
even after complete Spiriflor transition,

04:39.369 --> 04:44.582
there's no reason to remain human
on this oxygen-deprived Earth anymore.

04:45.166 --> 04:49.087
We must capture it alive
before the police do.

04:49.671 --> 04:52.674
That's our top priority.

04:59.014 --> 05:01.850
Hi, my name is Mine Yatsuka.
I'm a police inspector.

05:02.684 --> 05:04.602
Another "Yatsuka"?

05:07.439 --> 05:11.318
Akira, that's another dashing suit
you've got there.

05:11.818 --> 05:13.737
Auntie, read the room.

05:14.321 --> 05:16.364
I've summarized the details.

05:16.948 --> 05:19.159
Regarding this series of events,

05:19.242 --> 05:22.120
we ask for your continued assistance
as Spiriflor experts.

05:22.203 --> 05:23.621
OVERVIEW: THE IVY MURDERS

05:24.205 --> 05:27.625
Excuse me, what is "Ivy" referring to?

05:27.709 --> 05:31.880
We're nicknaming the culprit "Ivy"
due to its vine-like appearance.

05:31.963 --> 05:33.757
Convenient, right?

05:33.840 --> 05:35.550
The simpler, the better.

05:35.633 --> 05:36.718
Ivy…

05:41.014 --> 05:41.848
It's on fire…

05:42.432 --> 05:44.059
Incendiary bullets.

05:44.142 --> 05:49.272
Past incidents led us to assume
that the killer is a mobile Spiriflor.

05:49.355 --> 05:51.858
So, we made bullets to ignite upon impact.

05:51.941 --> 05:55.361
We never imagined the culprit
to be a full-body Spiriflor,

05:55.445 --> 05:59.616
but all officers involved in the case
now carry this gun.

05:59.699 --> 06:01.242
Wait a minute, Ms. Yatsuka.

06:02.118 --> 06:04.829
Do you intend to burn Ivy to the ground?

06:04.913 --> 06:07.749
That'll scorch any chance
of solving this case.

06:07.832 --> 06:13.379
I understand that you're all aiming
to find the truth behind Horai's case,

06:13.963 --> 06:16.633
but our citizens' lives
are more important.

06:17.217 --> 06:21.387
On the police side of things,
we're devoted to killing Ivy for good.

06:21.471 --> 06:26.309
Regardless, we must handle this before the
anti-transfloration movement catches wind.

06:29.104 --> 06:31.898
THE IVY MURDERS
TERMS FOR JOINT INVESTIGATION

06:31.981 --> 06:32.941
Don't worry.

06:33.817 --> 06:35.902
I won't put you in danger.

06:35.985 --> 06:39.155
ONLY NATIONAL POLICE HQ PERSONNEL
MAY CARRY INCENDIARY BULLETS

06:48.123 --> 06:52.669
<i>Transflora Medical! Transflora Medical!</i>

06:53.253 --> 06:55.088
Meg, how are your studies going?

06:55.588 --> 06:58.424
Great. Next time, I'll get an A for sure.

06:59.425 --> 07:01.427
Well, you'd better work hard.

07:01.511 --> 07:05.056
So you can grow up without
getting screwed by this shitty society.

07:05.723 --> 07:08.810
Oh, Dad. You're always nagging about that.

07:11.521 --> 07:13.356
Man, that sucks.

07:16.151 --> 07:20.738
Stop. Don't you dare eat that.
I'll give you my tofu jelly, okay?

07:21.239 --> 07:23.450
But you were supposed to eat that…

07:24.033 --> 07:25.869
It's fine, Meg. You can have it.

07:26.661 --> 07:27.954
Okay, thanks.

07:28.455 --> 07:31.583
Gotta pay in advance here. That okay?

07:37.672 --> 07:41.718
That's all you have? I figured as much.

07:42.469 --> 07:44.304
You're getting soup. That's it.

07:48.475 --> 07:49.851
Poor thing.

07:50.351 --> 07:53.146
Hey, can I give them
the food I just dropped?

07:53.229 --> 07:55.773
I feel bad for people who can't eat.

07:55.857 --> 07:56.983
Watch yourself.

07:59.861 --> 08:00.987
Excuse me…

08:02.614 --> 08:04.491
You can have these if you'd like…

08:07.660 --> 08:09.329
Wait a second.

08:11.080 --> 08:12.749
It's covered in dirt.

08:13.333 --> 08:17.128
Young lady,
do you treat your friends like this too?

08:17.879 --> 08:19.797
You don't want it?

08:22.342 --> 08:23.176
C'mon…

08:23.259 --> 08:25.178
See? I knew you were hungry.

08:25.762 --> 08:29.307
It's fine, don't worry.
Eat as much as you want.

08:32.143 --> 08:36.397
Someday, you'll be
eating food off the ground too.

08:38.733 --> 08:39.817
Now I'm pissed.

08:39.901 --> 08:41.277
Abolish transfloration!

08:41.361 --> 08:43.530
Stop raising oxygen tax!

08:44.739 --> 08:50.453
As the anti-transfloration movement,
we firmly oppose the oxygen tax increase!

08:52.997 --> 08:54.415
Good night.

08:55.166 --> 08:56.501
Good night.

09:12.934 --> 09:15.019
RESIDENT TAX DEMAND NOTICE

09:15.103 --> 09:17.689
OXYGEN TAX DEMAND NOTICE

09:17.772 --> 09:19.148
HIGH SCHOOL ENROLLMENT INFO

09:19.232 --> 09:21.693
APPLICATION FEE
5,000 YEN PER DOCUMENT

09:21.776 --> 09:25.655
MUST SUBMIT AT LEAST THREE DOCUMENTS

09:27.448 --> 09:30.285
I only got 40,000.
How am I supposed to pay these?

09:33.246 --> 09:34.163
Like I said, sir.

09:34.247 --> 09:39.002
Why am I being charged so much
just to submit the application?

09:39.085 --> 09:39.919
This is absurd!

09:40.003 --> 09:42.463
It's just a rule of ours.

09:42.547 --> 09:45.425
I can't afford to pay 15,000 yen.

09:45.925 --> 09:49.679
Then why don't you ask Meg
to give up on school and find a job?

09:51.598 --> 09:55.184
Are you saying my daughter's whole future
rides on this 15,000 yen?

09:56.644 --> 09:57.729
Pardon me.

09:58.271 --> 10:01.983
Would you like me to shoulder
those fees for you, Mr. Okumura?

10:02.483 --> 10:03.568
Principal…

10:03.651 --> 10:06.821
What?! You'd really do that?

10:06.904 --> 10:07.739
Yes.

10:08.698 --> 10:11.200
But on one condition.

10:11.784 --> 10:13.036
Condition?

10:14.287 --> 10:16.706
35TH ANTI-TRANSFLORATION ASSEMBLY
"WARM DAYS"

10:17.290 --> 10:20.543
Transfloration procedures
interfere with God's natural order!

10:20.627 --> 10:24.464
That blasphemous Transflora Medical
is an enemy of this world itself.

10:25.048 --> 10:26.841
- Amen!
- Well said!

10:26.924 --> 10:28.301
All living creatures

10:28.384 --> 10:32.930
were born into this world
with their form bestowed by God.

10:33.014 --> 10:37.310
For contradicting divine providence,
we must fight against Transflora Medical.

10:37.393 --> 10:38.353
<i>I hate this.</i>

10:38.436 --> 10:42.190
<i>Just bear with it.</i>
<i>For the sake of those applications…</i>

10:42.273 --> 10:43.983
Next speaker.

10:44.776 --> 10:47.487
<i>I've seen her at Meg's school before.</i>

10:48.112 --> 10:49.989
<i>That's Saito's mom.</i>

10:51.824 --> 10:53.117
I have no money.

10:54.202 --> 10:59.749
The oxygen tax we're forced to pay
goes directly to transfloration subsidies.

11:00.333 --> 11:05.254
The other day, a feature on TV
depicted Spiriflora living in total bliss.

11:05.338 --> 11:10.051
Buying up expensive brands,
eating beef and fruit,

11:10.134 --> 11:11.886
and having fun at an amusement park.

11:12.470 --> 11:16.015
My family hasn't done
a single one of those things.

11:16.683 --> 11:20.603
I'm asking the Transfloration Board
to repeal or reduce oxygen tax.

11:23.106 --> 11:27.777
People are getting ten million yen
without having to work for it.

11:27.860 --> 11:30.655
Why should we give dying people money?

11:30.738 --> 11:33.533
We're laboring, but for what purpose?

11:36.369 --> 11:40.248
The Transfloration Board plants seeds,
which eventually take root in us

11:40.331 --> 11:43.459
and absorb all of our nutrients
to grow flowers.

11:43.543 --> 11:48.673
Under this policy, we're already
trekking down a slow road to death.

11:52.260 --> 11:54.303
PROPERTY OF NATIONAL POLICE HQ

11:55.012 --> 11:58.224
Bunch of fools who don't know
how the world works…

11:58.850 --> 11:59.684
Hello?

12:00.309 --> 12:05.273
<i>The opposition still has no idea</i>
<i>the killer is an active Spiriflor.</i>

12:05.356 --> 12:07.066
Okay, very well.

12:07.650 --> 12:10.403
We're re-examining a victim's residence.

12:10.486 --> 12:11.821
We found a new lead.

12:21.747 --> 12:27.378
After murdering Eisuke Hiyama's family,
Ivy raided this room.

12:28.337 --> 12:32.216
It dragged Hiyama out of the window
and escaped.

12:32.300 --> 12:35.303
Eisuke Hiyama remains
in critical condition after the fall.

12:35.887 --> 12:38.055
Critical condition? He's still alive?

12:38.639 --> 12:43.936
They planted a seed to keep him alive
for questioning, but he transitioned fast.

12:48.524 --> 12:49.942
Take a look.

12:50.526 --> 12:54.322
We reinvestigated
after learning that Ivy could climb walls.

12:54.405 --> 12:57.533
And we found cracks
along the apartment building.

12:57.617 --> 13:02.455
Cracks from the escape were deeper
than the ones it left while breaking in.

13:03.039 --> 13:06.667
That means Ivy took something
from this floor.

13:06.751 --> 13:09.754
So, you brought us here to search for it?

13:28.439 --> 13:30.107
<i>I can hear voices.</i>

13:30.191 --> 13:33.903
<i>I could be searching for it…</i>
<i>Why am I wasting time here?</i>

13:39.200 --> 13:42.620
- Something's behind this wall.
- What?

13:44.080 --> 13:45.623
How do you know?

13:46.666 --> 13:47.625
I just do.

13:47.708 --> 13:49.835
It's probably a hidden room.

13:49.919 --> 13:54.632
We might find the reason
that Ivy attacked Hiyama's family.

13:54.715 --> 13:58.761
Didn't we tell you to refrain
from spilling information to the police?

13:59.512 --> 14:02.056
I'm doing this to kill Ivy.

14:02.557 --> 14:05.726
If you guys wanna "capture it alive,"
I'd rather the police--

14:05.810 --> 14:08.479
The police are merely using us.

14:08.563 --> 14:14.360
They have flaming bullets, yet we're
completely unarmed. That's obvious proof.

14:15.861 --> 14:18.656
That's why we're using them back.
To gain intel.

14:19.156 --> 14:24.245
I couldn't care less about Kunibe's plan.
But I need a promotion, or I'm screwed.

14:25.121 --> 14:30.585
But what's intel gonna do for us?
Transflora Medical doesn't have an army.

14:30.668 --> 14:32.128
You're so pathetically lame.

14:32.879 --> 14:35.548
Everyone's already moving on their own.

14:36.257 --> 14:39.302
That Kunibe geezer
already assembled his own army.

14:39.385 --> 14:41.804
Even I've recruited a veteran soldier.

14:42.638 --> 14:44.181
So, what about you?

14:44.891 --> 14:47.560
Are you really prepared to get revenge?

14:51.439 --> 14:52.481
Hello?

14:52.565 --> 14:56.569
<i>Is this Toshiro Kamiya?</i>
<i>Please come to the hospital immediately.</i>

14:57.153 --> 14:59.739
<i>We're removing</i>
<i>half of Yomiko Horai's stomach.</i>

15:01.073 --> 15:02.825
<i>Hello? Are you there?</i>

15:07.788 --> 15:08.956
Hey, what are you doing?

15:09.832 --> 15:11.208
Going to the hospital.

15:14.712 --> 15:16.380
Stop, you moron!

15:19.300 --> 15:23.679
Do you even have a license?
Like hell you do! Stop this car!

15:24.263 --> 15:27.058
Stop!

15:34.690 --> 15:35.900
He's dead to me.

15:49.914 --> 15:50.915
<i>Scared…</i>

16:03.552 --> 16:04.762
<i>She's scared…</i>

16:10.643 --> 16:11.811
Yomiko…

16:47.430 --> 16:48.723
<i>I'll kill you…</i>

16:48.806 --> 16:49.932
<i>I'll kill you…</i>

16:50.599 --> 16:52.476
<i>- Kill…</i>
<i>- Kill…</i>

16:52.560 --> 16:54.353
<i>Kill…</i>

17:07.241 --> 17:08.367
<i>Won't you regret it?</i>

17:08.451 --> 17:09.410
<i>Kill.</i>

17:09.493 --> 17:11.245
<i>Quit while you're ahead.</i>

17:11.328 --> 17:12.163
<i>Hatred.</i>

17:12.246 --> 17:13.122
<i>Sad, huh?</i>

17:13.706 --> 17:15.541
<i>My emotions are leaking out.</i>

17:16.250 --> 17:17.376
<i>I need to calm myself.</i>

17:18.127 --> 17:20.379
<i>Otherwise, I won't hear</i>
<i>Ivy's thirst to kill.</i>

17:22.465 --> 17:23.632
All clear.

17:23.716 --> 17:24.550
This one too.

17:25.051 --> 17:28.387
Not smuggling anything, I see.
Thanks for your hard work.

17:29.096 --> 17:30.639
What are they suspecting?

17:31.432 --> 17:35.227
Considering the timing,
I'm guessing Toshiro's up to something.

17:35.311 --> 17:36.395
Did you call him?

17:36.479 --> 17:37.897
He won't answer.

17:38.481 --> 17:40.524
<i>He hasn't shown up in three days.</i>

17:40.608 --> 17:41.901
<i>You mocking me?</i>

17:41.984 --> 17:43.778
<i>I have children.</i>

17:44.612 --> 17:46.322
<i>It's like I've grown wings.</i>

17:46.405 --> 17:48.532
<i>Something feels off.</i>

17:52.870 --> 17:55.247
<i>Take better care of yourself.</i>

17:56.707 --> 17:57.541
Shut up!

17:59.627 --> 18:01.462
<i>I got nothing left to vomit.</i>

18:15.559 --> 18:18.687
It's progressing.
Because I used my ability…

18:29.865 --> 18:30.699
Yomiko…

18:31.534 --> 18:35.704
Yomiko. Yomiko. Yomiko. Yomiko. Yomiko…

18:40.626 --> 18:43.087
<i>It's just crawling</i>
<i>under the top layer of my skin.</i>

18:43.671 --> 18:45.840
<i>Calm down, calm down.</i>

18:49.385 --> 18:51.345
<i>Gotta listen for that thirst to kill.</i>

19:20.833 --> 19:21.750
<i>I'll kill you…</i>

19:23.586 --> 19:28.757
<i>Kill. Kill. Kill. Kill. Kill…</i>

19:32.094 --> 19:33.262
There he is.

19:33.846 --> 19:36.515
As expected, he was near the hospital.

19:36.599 --> 19:37.766
<i>Chase him.</i>

19:56.702 --> 19:57.661
Who are you?

19:59.496 --> 20:00.664
<i>Wrong guy…</i>

20:04.460 --> 20:06.712
You came to kill me too, huh?

20:06.795 --> 20:08.005
Damn it.

20:08.088 --> 20:13.427
Do you guys have any idea
how much I've done for this crew?!

20:13.510 --> 20:15.137
Be grateful to me!

20:17.473 --> 20:19.892
Clench your teeth, please.

20:24.939 --> 20:26.523
You okay?

20:28.776 --> 20:30.986
The people at the bottom of those stairs…

20:32.112 --> 20:34.031
Nice job, Kanaeno.

20:34.114 --> 20:35.616
No sweat.

20:40.621 --> 20:43.040
What are you doing?

20:43.123 --> 20:46.043
You stole that gun
from the police, didn't you?

20:48.128 --> 20:51.048
You're fired from Transflora Medical.

20:51.632 --> 20:53.050
Punitive dismissal.

20:54.885 --> 20:56.095
Wait.

20:57.388 --> 20:58.472
Hold on.

20:59.056 --> 21:01.684
No… You can't fire me.

21:02.268 --> 21:07.064
Come on, that gun
is my only means of avenging Yomiko!

21:08.399 --> 21:11.110
It's the only way I…

21:12.653 --> 21:13.862
Okay, I get it now!

21:14.446 --> 21:15.864
I'll cooperate!

21:16.365 --> 21:19.368
I'll commit to capturing Ivy
through legal means!

21:20.327 --> 21:22.496
I'm Deputy Chief of HR.

21:22.579 --> 21:24.999
This judgment cannot be overruled.

21:25.582 --> 21:26.750
Farewell.

23:46.932 --> 23:51.937
Subtitle translation by: Logan Lampkins
